OL,3,GNEWSANew routes as buses taken under
OL,4,Apublic control
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo new bus routes have been announced
OL,7,Facross the Wirral as the network
OL,8,Freturns to public control for the first
OL,9,Ftime in 40 years.
OL,11,FThe move, which is hoped to improve
OL,12,Fhospital transport links, will come
OL,13,Finto effect on 25 October. It forms the
OL,14,Fsecond phase of a roll out which sees
OL,15,Fthe bus network in the region return to
OL,16,Fpublic ownership, after last month's
OL,17,Flaunch in St Helen's.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1791627942
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew routes as buses taken under
OL,4,Apublic control
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 453 service will connect Irby and
OL,7,FHeswall to the Clatterbridge Hospital,
OL,8,Fwhile the 483/484 circular services
OL,9,Fwill link Arrowe Park Hospital with
OL,10,FWest Kirby, Meols, Hoylake, Moreton and
OL,11,FUpton.
OL,13,FMayor of the Liverpool City Region,
OL,14,FSteve Rotherham, said public ownership
OL,15,Fwas "about building a network that
OL,16,Fworks for passengers".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
